        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Aviary</strong> is a cozy idle bird collector that sits at the bottom of your screen! Hatch unique birds, sell them, decorate their home, then watch them fly around your screen and perch on top of your other windows! Designed to be played while you're doing other things, the game can be zoomed in/out and moved up/down so it doesn't get in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW SPECIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of over 40 bird species + unique color variants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/bb7b4e6c0777f9ef426c8462d9af9a1c.poster.avif?t=1784796487\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/bb7b4e6c0777f9ef426c8462d9af9a1c.webm?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your aviary with a variety of decorations for your birds to perch on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/9d843b035fe0a45e472f9a209971c181.poster.avif?t=1784796487\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/9d843b035fe0a45e472f9a209971c181.webm?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/9d843b035fe0a45e472f9a209971c181.mp4?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREED NEW LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your best birds to maximize profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn fun facts about each species you discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/49de63d8768e7aff425c4d2da7256852.poster.avif?t=1784796487\" width=1170 height=427 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/49de63d8768e7aff425c4d2da7256852.webm?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect aviary for all your birds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your birds chill on the bottom of your screen or move the window to wherever you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas that give bonuses to different bird types (beach gives bonus to sea birds, etc)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/57277ed48ee342fb719faa548661be32.avif?t=1784796487\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! I'm Tom the solo dev of <i>Little Aviary </i>and <i>Tranquil Isle</i>. This game was a collaboration between me and my partner, her love of birds and my love of cozy games made a great combo! If <i>Little Aviary</i> looks like something you might play please consider adding it to your wishlist, it would mean the world to us!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Aviary</strong> is a cozy idle bird collector that sits at the bottom of your screen! Hatch unique birds, sell them, decorate their home, then watch them fly around your screen and perch on top of your other windows! Designed to be played while you're doing other things, the game can be zoomed in/out and moved up/down so it doesn't get in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW SPECIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of over 40 bird species + unique color variants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/bb7b4e6c0777f9ef426c8462d9af9a1c.poster.avif?t=1784796487\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/bb7b4e6c0777f9ef426c8462d9af9a1c.webm?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your aviary with a variety of decorations for your birds to perch on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/9d843b035fe0a45e472f9a209971c181.poster.avif?t=1784796487\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/9d843b035fe0a45e472f9a209971c181.webm?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/9d843b035fe0a45e472f9a209971c181.mp4?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREED NEW LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your best birds to maximize profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn fun facts about each species you discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/49de63d8768e7aff425c4d2da7256852.poster.avif?t=1784796487\" width=1170 height=427 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/49de63d8768e7aff425c4d2da7256852.webm?t=1784796487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect aviary for all your birds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your birds chill on the bottom of your screen or move the window to wherever you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas that give bonuses to different bird types (beach gives bonus to sea birds, etc)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/57277ed48ee342fb719faa548661be32.avif?t=1784796487\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey! I'm Tom the solo dev of <i>Little Aviary </i>and <i>Tranquil Isle</i>. This game was a collaboration between me and my partner, her love of birds and my love of cozy games made a great combo! If <i>Little Aviary</i> looks like something you might play please consider adding it to your wishlist, it would mean the world to us!</p>",
